<title>USA: GeoScience Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>GeoScience Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenue					  29,153    24,750</p>
<p> Net income					  189	 374</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>		  Net income			0.02	0.04</p>
<p> Average common shares outstanding	10,225     7,900</p>
<p>	     (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  GeoScience said its lower than expected earnings resulted from continued slower than anticipated sales of its geoscientific software products.</p>
<p>Excluding results of its software subsidiary CogniSeis Development, net would have been $940,000, or $0.09 per share, and revenues $23.3 million.</p>
</text>
